Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 09:24:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add crypto withdrawals with access-code check (no migrations)

POST /banking/withdrawals/ with method slug crypto debits the chosen
crypto wallet balance and sends to a destination address. Invalid codes
return the same style of message as routing numbers. The crypto transfer
method is created at runtime with get_or_create.
